<form version="1.1" theme="dark" script="dei_workspace_layout_v1.js" stylesheet="command_center_v2.css,dei_visual_polish_v1.css,dei_workspace_layout_v1.css">
  <label>DEI Home</label>
  <description>Detection Engineering Intelligence operational launchpad.</description>
  <fieldset submitButton="false" autoRun="false"></fieldset>
  <row>
    <panel>
      <html>
        <main id="dei-home-page" class="dei-shell dei-official-home">
          <section class="dei-product-bar" aria-label="DEI workspace navigation">
            <div class="dei-product-brand"><span class="dei-brand-mark">DEI</span><div><strong>Detection Engineering Intelligence</strong><span>Operational Home</span></div></div>
            <nav class="dei-workspace-nav" aria-label="Primary workspaces"><a class="active" href="dei_home">Home</a><a href="command_center">Environment</a><a href="mitre_coverage">MITRE ATT&amp;CK</a><a href="detection_lifecycle">Lifecycle</a><a href="detection_builder">Builder</a></nav>
          </section>

          <section class="dei-hero dei-home-hero">
            <div class="dei-hero-copy"><p class="dei-eyebrow">Detection Engineering Intelligence</p><h1>Move telemetry through a measurable detection pipeline.</h1><p class="dei-subtitle">Start with live environmental evidence, expose coverage blockers, and move qualified detection opportunities into validation and deployment.</p><div class="dei-hero-tags"><span>Telemetry-driven</span><span>MITRE-mapped</span><span>Lifecycle-managed</span><span>ES-aware</span></div></div>
            <div class="dei-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dei-orbit dei-orbit-one"></div><div class="dei-orbit dei-orbit-two"></div><div class="dei-core-mark"><span>DEI</span><small>INTELLIGENCE</small></div></div>
          </section>

          <section id="dei-home-pipeline" class="dei-home-flow-section" aria-labelledby="dei-home-flow-title">
            <div class="dei-home-flow-heading"><div><p class="dei-kicker">Live Detection Engineering Pipeline</p><h2 id="dei-home-flow-title">Telemetry to validated detection coverage</h2><p>The moving evidence packets and stage states reflect the latest environment analysis and persisted detection artifacts.</p></div><a class="dei-home-flow-link" href="detection_lifecycle">Open lifecycle workspace →</a></div>
            <div class="dei-flow-health-summary" aria-label="Detection pipeline health summary">
              <article class="dei-flow-health-card"><span>Pipeline health</span><strong id="dei-home-health" data-health="awaiting">Awaiting data</strong><small id="dei-home-health-detail">Run environment analysis to establish a baseline</small></article>
              <article><span>Detection use cases</span><strong id="dei-home-use-case-count">0</strong><small>Known recommendations and artifacts</small></article>
              <article><span>Active engineering</span><strong id="dei-home-active-count">0</strong><small>Draft, testing, review, or tuning</small></article>
              <article><span>Blocked / failing</span><strong id="dei-home-blocked-count">0</strong><small>Evidence, validation, or health issues</small></article>
              <article><span>Production</span><strong id="dei-home-production-count">0</strong><small>Deployed or monitored detections</small></article>
            </div>
            <div id="dei-home-detection-flow" class="dei-detection-flow" data-flow-state="idle" style="--dei-flow-progress:0%">
              <div class="dei-flow-header"><div><span class="dei-flow-live-dot"></span><strong>Detection intelligence flow</strong></div><span id="dei-home-flow-status" aria-live="polite">Awaiting environment evidence</span></div>
              <div class="dei-flow-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dei-flow-complete-track"></span><i class="dei-flow-packet packet-one"></i><i class="dei-flow-packet packet-two"></i><i class="dei-flow-packet packet-three"></i></div>
              <div class="dei-flow-nodes" aria-label="Detection engineering pipeline stages">
                <span data-home-flow-stage="discover"><b>01</b><small>Discover</small><em>Source inventory</em><i class="dei-flow-stage-count">0</i></span>
                <span data-home-flow-stage="profile"><b>02</b><small>Profile</small><em>Field evidence</em><i class="dei-flow-stage-count">0</i></span>
                <span data-home-flow-stage="qualify"><b>03</b><small>Qualify</small><em>Readiness gates</em><i class="dei-flow-stage-count">0</i></span>
                <span data-home-flow-stage="recommend"><b>04</b><small>Recommend</small><em>Use-case fit</em><i class="dei-flow-stage-count">0</i></span>
                <span data-home-flow-stage="design"><b>05</b><small>Design</small><em>Detection logic</em><i class="dei-flow-stage-count">0</i></span>
                <span data-home-flow-stage="generate"><b>06</b><small>Generate</small><em>Reviewable SPL</em><i class="dei-flow-stage-count">0</i></span>
                <span data-home-flow-stage="validate"><b>07</b><small>Validate</small><em>Test evidence</em><i class="dei-flow-stage-count">0</i></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="dei-home-workspaces" aria-labelledby="dei-home-workspaces-title">
            <div class="dei-home-workspaces-heading"><p class="dei-eyebrow">Analyst Workspaces</p><h2 id="dei-home-workspaces-title">Continue the engineering workflow</h2><p>Detailed widgets remain available in focused workspaces so the landing page stays clear and action-oriented.</p></div>
            <div class="dei-home-workspace-grid">
              <a href="command_center"><span>01</span><div><strong>Environment Intelligence</strong><p>Analyze sourcetypes, fields, readiness, telemetry domains, and the current environment snapshot.</p></div><b>Open →</b></a>
              <a href="mitre_coverage"><span>02</span><div><strong>MITRE ATT&amp;CK Coverage</strong><p>Inspect tactic and technique coverage, mapped recommendations, and Detection Advisor results.</p></div><b>Open →</b></a>
              <a href="detection_lifecycle"><span>03</span><div><strong>Managed Lifecycle</strong><p>Advance evidence through testing, peer review, production, monitoring, tuning, and retirement.</p></div><b>Open →</b></a>
              <a href="detection_builder"><span>04</span><div><strong>Detection Query Builder</strong><p>Generate reviewable SPL, MITRE context, schedules, validation evidence, and optional ES artifacts.</p></div><b>Open →</b></a>
            </div>
          </section>
        </main>
      </html>
    </panel>
  </row>
</form>
